{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Overview</u>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critter Chaos TD is a fast, frantic and chaotic Tower Defence game in which you must rid the world of the evil Critters. Build stations and guns to fortify your defences and prevent the various types of Critters from reaching your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071310/extras/d8b74742d88a1fd04ab962bd1e08fcf5.avif?t=1766944968\" width=640 height=640 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Current status</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different types of Critters (more to come)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different types of Guns (more to come)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different upgrade options (more to come)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different types of Stations (more to come)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different types of Special Weapons (more to come)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 different levels with 3 boss fights (25 expected)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade mode under development (coming soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Rush mode under development (coming soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boosts can be purchased with EXP (coming soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheat codes can unlock bonus content (coming soon)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071310/extras/528978ee59ffcb5d3b52662aec9b48fd.avif?t=1766944968\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Features</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countdown and Strategy modes available to cater to those who like making fast decisions and also those who prefer to take their time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently 3 upgraded gun variants available for each gun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns can be repaired and demolished if the damage is too significant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Points earned in the game can be used to purchase Special Weapons to provide a tactical advantage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are objectives to complete on each level and performance will be ranked\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns/Stations and Special Weapons will be unlocked based on progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different modes and weapons can also be unlocked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy, Medium and Hard difficulties are available</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomised arenas so no 2 playthroughs are ever the same</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training mode for getting used to the interface and commands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mode for challenging how long a player can last against a relentless swarm of Critters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High score table for Survival mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress will be saved automatically</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse